              "text": "The wave has intensity I₁ at distance x = 2.0 cm and intensity I₂ at x = 10.0 cm.\nDetermine the ratio I₂/I₁.",
              "latex": "The wave has intensity $I_1$ at distance $x = 2.0\\,\\mathrm{cm}$ and intensity $I_2$ at $x = 10.0\\,\\mathrm{cm}$.\nDetermine the ratio $I_2/I_1$.",
