                  "When R₃ = 24 Ω, the parallel combination is 1/R_parallel = 1/12 + 1/24, giving R_parallel = 8.0 Ω.",
                  "This 8.0 Ω combination is in series with R₁, so R_total = 6.0 + 8.0 = 14 Ω.",
                  "The battery current is I = 14/14 = 1.0 A."
