              "latex": "A cathode-ray oscilloscope (c.r.o.) is used to determine the frequency of the sound emitted by a loudspeaker. The trace produced on the screen of the c.r.o. is shown in Fig. 4.1. The time-base setting of the c.r.o. is 250 µs cm^{-1}. Show that the frequency of the sound wave is 1600 Hz.",
