                  "With time-base setting 250 μs cm⁻¹, the period T = 2.5 cm × 250 μs cm⁻¹ = 625 μs = 6.25 × 10⁻⁴ s.",
                  "Frequency is the reciprocal of the period: f = 1/T = 1 / (6.25 × 10⁻⁴ s) = 1600 Hz."
