              "text": "Switch S in Fig. 6.1 is now opened. Resistors R1 and R2 are made from metal wires. Some data for these resistors are shown in Fig. 6.2. Determine the ratio: average drift speed of free electrons in R1 / average drift speed of free electrons in R2. ratio =",
              "latex": "Switch S in Fig. 6.1 is now opened. Resistors $R_1$ and $R_2$ are made from metal wires. Some data for these resistors are shown in Fig. 6.2. Determine the ratio $\\frac{\\text{average drift speed of free electrons in }R_1}{\\text{average drift speed of free electrons in }R_2}$. $\\text{ratio} =$",
